	"Aliases": "Muqobil",
	"back to the map start": "kartaning boshiga qaytish",
	"Back to the map start, also out of spectator. During a run type it twice within 3 seconds - the first one only warns (Options › Gameplay › Confirm !r).": "Karta boshiga qaytish, kuzatuvdan ham. Yugurishda 3 soniya ichida ikki marta yozing - birinchisi faqat ogohlantiradi (Sozlamalar › O'yin › !r tasdig'i).",
	"back to the start of your stage / bonus": "bosqich / bonusingiz boshiga qaytish",
	"Back to the start of the stage or bonus you're on, otherwise the map start. From spectator: back to where you were, a paused run goes on.": "Turgan bosqich yoki bonusingiz boshiga, aks holda karta boshiga. Kuzatuvdan: turgan joyingizga qaytasiz, to'xtatilgan yugurish davom etadi.",
	"teleport to a stage": "bosqichga teleport",
	"Teleports you to stage n and resets your timer (stage mode). Staged maps only. Without a number: a picker with every stage and its tier.": "n-bosqichga ko'chiradi va taymerni tiklaydi (bosqich rejimi). Faqat bosqichli kartalarda. Raqamsiz: barcha bosqichlar va ularning tieri ro'yxati.",
	"teleport to a bonus": "bonusga teleport",
	"Teleports you to bonus n - you stay on it until !r, !s or !b. Without a number: bonus 1, or a picker when the map has several.": "n-bonusga ko'chiradi - !r, !s yoki !b gacha unda qolasiz. Raqamsiz: 1-bonus yoki bir nechta bo'lsa ro'yxat.",
	"teleport to the end of your course": "yo'lingiz oxiriga teleport",
	"From the start zone of your course (map, bonus, or the stage in stage mode): teleports you to its end. The timer stops and doesn't finish there. Several end zones: pick one.": "Yo'lingiz start zonasidan (karta, bonus yoki bosqich rejimida bosqich): oxiriga ko'chiradi. Taymer to'xtaydi, finish hisoblanmaydi. Bir nechta oxir zonasi bo'lsa - birini tanlang.",
	"your settings: HUD, visibility, chat, sound": "sozlamalar: HUD, ko'rinish, chat, ovoz",
	"HUD layout (bottom and center fields), speed colors, splits panel, hiding players / bots, trails, chat messages, sounds.": "HUD maketi (pastki va markaziy maydonlar), tezlik ranglari, splitlar paneli, o'yinchi / botlarni yashirish, izlar, chat xabarlari, ovozlar.",
	"this list": "shu ro'yxat",
	"Without a command: every command, by tab. With a command (e.g. !help saveloc): its details in chat.": "Buyruqsiz: barcha buyruqlar tablar bo'yicha. Buyruq bilan (masalan !help saveloc): tafsilotlari chatda.",
	"save your position": "joyingizni saqlash",
	"Saves your position, view, speed and run as a server-wide #id. While spectating it saves who you watch. In a start zone you must stand still. Loaded runs are practice.": "Joyingiz, qarash, tezlik va yugurishni server bo'ylab #id sifatida saqlaydi. Kuzatayotganda kuzatilayotganni saqlaydi. Start zonasida qimirlamay turing. Yuklangan yugurish - mashq.",
	"back to your saveloc, or load one": "saqlangan joyga qaytish yoki yuklash",
	"No id: back to your current saveloc. With an id: loads that saveloc, also someone else's (it's added to your set).": "id siz: joriy saqlangan joyingizga. id bilan: o'sha joyni yuklaydi, birovnikini ham (to'plamingizga qo'shiladi).",
	"previous saveloc in your set": "to'plamdagi oldingi joy",
	"next saveloc in your set": "to'plamdagi keyingi joy",
	"saveloc menu": "saqlangan joylar menyusi",
	"Tabs: My set, Recent (everyone's latest), Import, Info.": "Tablar: To'plamim, So'nggi (hammaning oxirgilari), Import, Ma'lumot.",
	"fly - turns your timer off until !r": "uchish - taymer !r gacha o'chadi",
	"Noclip on / off. Your run is reset and the timer stays off (no zones, no savelocs) until !r or !rs, which also end noclip. !noclip again lands you where you are. Map teleports: Options › Gameplay › Noclip teleports (normal / set back / disabled).": "Noclip yoq / o'ch. Yugurish tiklanadi, taymer !r yoki !rs gacha o'chiq (zona va saqlangan joylarsiz), ular noclipni ham tugatadi. Yana !noclip - turgan joyingizga tushasiz. Karta teleportlari: Sozlamalar › O'yin › Noclip teleportlari.",
	"repeat mode on / off": "takror rejimi yoq / o'ch",
	"After each stage you go back to that stage's start. Staged maps only, off every time you join.": "Har bosqichdan keyin o'sha bosqich boshiga qaytasiz. Faqat bosqichli kartalarda, har kirishda o'chiq.",
	"your rank on this map": "bu kartadagi o'rningiz",
	"map panel: info, records, stages, bonuses": "karta paneli: ma'lumot, rekordlar, bosqichlar, bonuslar",
	"The map panel for this map or another one. Tabs: Map, Records, Stages, Checkpoints, Bonuses.": "Bu yoki boshqa karta paneli. Tablar: Karta, Rekordlar, Bosqichlar, CP lar, Bonuslar.",
	"map records": "karta rekordlari",
	"stage records": "bosqich rekordlari",
	"With a number: that stage's board.": "Raqam bilan: o'sha bosqich jadvali.",
	"bonus records": "bonus rekordlari",
	"checkpoint records": "CP rekordlari",
	"your profile or another player's": "sizning yoki boshqa o'yinchi profili",
	"Online or offline players. Tabs: Overview, Points, Records, Recent, This map, Tiers.": "Onlayn yoki oflayn o'yinchilar. Tablar: Umumiy, Ochkolar, Rekordlar, So'nggi, Bu karta, Tierlar.",
	"top players by server rank": "server o'rni bo'yicha top o'yinchilar",
	"Normal style. A player opens their profile.": "Oddiy uslub. O'yinchini bossangiz profili ochiladi.",
	"spectate a player or bot": "o'yinchi yoki botni kuzatish",
	"By (partial) name, or a picker without one. Your run is paused - !back continues it.": "(Qisman) ism bo'yicha yoki ismsiz ro'yxatdan. Yugurish to'xtatiladi - !back davom ettiradi.",
	"replay menu": "replay menyusi",
	"Tabs: Map (WR, best segments, your PB), Stages, Bonuses, Checkpoints, Your PBs.": "Tablar: Karta (WR, eng yaxshi segmentlar, PB), Bosqichlar, Bonuslar, CP lar, PB laringiz.",
