	"Teleport, push, multiple, hurt and other triggers near you, drawn as outlines. Each kind on / off and its color: Options › Visibility › Triggers & clips. Admins only.": "Yaqiningizdagi teleport, push, multiple, hurt va boshqa triggerlar kontur bilan. Har turi va rangi: Sozlamalar › Ko'rinish › Triggerlar va cliplar. Faqat adminlar.",
	"draw the map's player clips on / off": "karta cliplarini chizish yoq / o'ch",
	"The map's invisible walls near you, drawn as outlines. Color: Options › Visibility › Triggers & clips › Player clips. Admins only.": "Yaqiningizdagi ko'rinmas devorlar kontur bilan. Rang: Sozlamalar › Ko'rinish › Triggerlar va cliplar › O'yinchi cliplari. Faqat adminlar.",
	"all timer sounds on / off": "barcha taymer ovozlari yoq / o'ch",
	"a code for all your HUD settings": "barcha HUD sozlamalaringiz kodi",
	"Every !options - HUD and Compare setting as an 8 character code. Others take it with !hudimport <code>. Codes stay forever.": "!options dagi barcha HUD va Taqqoslash sozlamalari 8 belgili kod sifatida. Boshqalar uni !hudimport <code> bilan oladi. Kodlar abadiy saqlanadi.",
	"take someone's HUD settings": "birovning HUD sozlamalarini olish",
	"Takes every HUD setting of a code from !hudexport - settings the code doesn't have go back to their defaults.": "!hudexport kodidagi barcha HUD sozlamalarini oladi - kodda yo'q sozlamalar standartga qaytadi.",
	"mouse cursor for popup menus on / off": "menyular uchun sichqoncha kursori yoq / o'ch",
	"Click the popup with the mouse, or move with it open. Bindable: bind <key> css_cursor.": "Menyuni sichqoncha bilan bosing yoki ochiq holda yuring. Bind: bind <key> css_cursor.",
